    <string name="scene_ferry_short_name">Ferry</string><string name="scene_ferry_name">Night Ferry Journey</string><string name="scene_ferry_description">Cast off, leave the harbor, cross dark open water, and wake as the ferry reaches shore.</string><string name="scene_ferry_asset_unavailable">The Night Ferry recordings are not packaged in this build.</string><string name="scene_ferry_unavailable">Night Ferry audio is not available in this build</string><string name="scene_ferry_spatial_hint">Engine presence, quiet deck detail, wave texture and night depth shape the crossing between dedicated departure and arrival beds.</string>
    <string name="scene_spacecraft_short_name">Spacecraft</string><string name="scene_spacecraft_name">Spacecraft Drift</string><string name="scene_spacecraft_description">Leave orbit, settle into a long deep-space drift, approach the destination, and dock quietly.</string><string name="scene_spacecraft_asset_unavailable">The Spacecraft recordings are not packaged in this build.</string><string name="scene_spacecraft_unavailable">Spacecraft audio is not available in this build</string><string name="scene_spacecraft_spatial_hint">Drive presence and hull texture shape a stable sleep-safe interior without sudden random events.</string>
    <string name="scene_submarine_short_name">Submarine</string><string name="scene_submarine_name">Submarine Voyage</string><string name="scene_submarine_description">Dive below the surface, settle into a deep cruise with rare sonar, then rise into a quiet arrival.</string><string name="scene_submarine_asset_unavailable">The Submarine recordings are not packaged in this build.</string><string name="scene_submarine_unavailable">Submarine audio is not available in this build</string><string name="scene_submarine_spatial_hint">Engine room and underwater beds move together; rare low-level sonar follows a sleep-safe event schedule.</string>
    <string name="scene_hood_short_name">HOOD</string><string name="scene_hood_name">HOOD Night</string><string name="scene_hood_description">A worn brick walk-up block after dark, with fire escapes, a fenced court, patched asphalt and optional incidents that unfold differently each night.</string><string name="scene_hood_asset_unavailable">The HOOD recordings are not packaged in this build.</string><string name="scene_hood_unavailable">HOOD audio is not available in this build</string><string name="scene_hood_spatial_hint">Short distant exchanges trade fire between two nearby positions, with shouts and screams at the same depth. One or more police sirens may approach the area 18–115 seconds later.</string>
    <string name="scene_forest_temple_short_name">Temple</string><string name="scene_forest_temple_name">Forest Temple</string><string name="scene_forest_temple_description">A bright forest temple for rest and meditation, with a singing bowl from the hall, birds, slow gravel footsteps and occasional verified sutra readings.</string><string name="scene_forest_temple_asset_unavailable">The forest-temple recordings are not packaged in this build.</string><string name="scene_forest_temple_unavailable">Forest Temple audio is not available in this build</string><string name="scene_forest_temple_spatial_hint">Sutra readings, moktak and singing bowl come softly from the temple hall on the right. Forest and birds remain wide; slow gravel footsteps appear along the path.</string>
